  "content_html": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEioLLZ9WAozzxq7dtVgufWZb2QYKnBFneo-MuyDJP42OV4JKnbcditY5SNXoEbbBl_tW7OaH25y2q_v06FIYt1X23p03IdmtxZ9MQa9QXMgR54K5cZbNZYN1HEyv7VJ6P0Xo-m0k2oObxSf_HzgQGWNX5Du6NmXC96NIkb8hTh4M-VHPg2xkT_vOjfgFPA/s1024/Designer%20-%202024-10-31T164854.278.jpeg\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEioLLZ9WAozzxq7dtVgufWZb2QYKnBFneo-MuyDJP42OV4JKnbcditY5SNXoEbbBl_tW7OaH25y2q_v06FIYt1X23p03IdmtxZ9MQa9QXMgR54K5cZbNZYN1HEyv7VJ6P0Xo-m0k2oObxSf_HzgQGWNX5Du6NmXC96NIkb8hTh4M-VHPg2xkT_vOjfgFPA/w320-h320/Designer%20-%202024-10-31T164854.278.jpeg\" /></a></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הצחוק יפה לבריאות – אבל לפעמים הוא גם מסוכן</span></h2><blockquote style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וַיִּפֹּל אַבְרָהָם עַל פָּנָיו וַיִּצְחָק</span></blockquote><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַרְבֵּה מִינֵי שְׂחוֹק</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בָּאוּ לָעוֹלָם,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כִּי יָפֶה הוּא הַצְּחוֹק</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בָּרִיא לְכֻלָּם.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְרִאשׁוֹנֵי הַצּוֹחֲקִים</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הָיוּ שָׂרַי וְאַבְרָם,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עַל לֶדֶת צֶאֱצָאִים</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בְּפִסְגַּת מְרוֹם גִּילָם.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְהָיָה צְחוֹק זֶה</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">שְׂחוֹק שֶׁל טָהֳרָה,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כִּצְחוֹק תִּינוֹק, נֶחֱזֶה</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מְחַיֵּךְ מִתּוֹךְ שֵׁנָה.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וּכְבַת הַשְּׂחֹק הַדַּקָּה</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הָעוֹלָה בְּזָוִיּוֹת הַשְּׂפָתַיִם,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">שֶׁל זִקְנֵי יְשִׁישֵׁי הַחָכְמָה</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">שֶׁרָאוּ דָּבָר אוֹ שְׁנַיִם.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עַל זֶה הַצְּחוֹק, אָמְרוּ,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">שֶׁהוּא יָפֶה לַלֵּב.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְכָל שׁוֹמְעָיו יָדְעוּ</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">שֶׁהוּא צְחוֹק אוֹהֵב.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲבָל תּוֹךְ זְמַן קָצָר</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">נוֹלַד גַּם צְחוֹק פָּרוּעַ,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְיִשְׁמָעֵאל בֶּן הָגָר</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מְצַחֵק בְּכָל אֵרוּעַ.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְהָיָה צְחוֹקוֹ מַפְחִיד</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">צְחוֹק שֶׁל חֵטְא וְרֶצַח,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְאֶת שָׂרֵי הֶחֱרִיד</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">צְחוֹק עַזּוּת הַמֵּצַח.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בְּרַם, יֵשׁ לוֹ לַגּוֹרָל</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">צְחוֹק מִשֶּׁל עַצְמוֹ,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְזֶה לֹא מַצְחִיק בִּכְלָל</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כְּשֶׁהוּא מִתְגַּלְגֵּל בִּצְחוֹקוֹ.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְהַצְּחוֹק נַעֲשֶׂה מִדַּבֵּק</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אוֹי, זֶה מַמָּשׁ קוֹרֵעַ,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְהַצְּחוֹק, צָחַק - הִתְחַזֵּק</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כִּצְחוֹקוֹ שֶׁל צָבוּעַ.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כִּי אֲנָשִׁים עָשׂוּ צְחוֹק</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְשָׁחֲטוּ פָּרוֹת קְדוֹשׁוֹת,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">צָחֲקוּ מֵהַחֹק</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">צָחֲקוּ עַד דְּמָעוֹת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">רָבְתָה הַבְּדִיחָה</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">גָּאֲתָה הַלֵּיצָנוּת,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עֲקִיצָה וּמְתִיחָה</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">גִּחוּךְ מַתִּירָנוּת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אָז נָכוֹן שֶׁפֹּה וָשָׁם</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">נוֹתְרָה עוֹד שְׁאֵרִית,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לַצְּחוֹק&nbsp;הַהוּא שֶׁל פַּעַם</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לַצְּחוֹק</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;שֶׁל בְּרֵאשִׁית.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַכַּלָּה שֶׁבְּבֵית חָמִיהָ</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מַחְנִיקָה בִּמְבוּכָה צִחְקוּק,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כְּמוֹ הַקָּהָל בַּיָּצִיעַ</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">שמַחְנִיק לוֹ פִּהוּק.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אַךְ הֵדֵי הַצְּחוֹק גָּבְרוּ</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְהַכֹּל נִבְלָע בְּגַלָּיו,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲנָשִׁים הִתְפּוֹצְצוּ</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כְּשֶׁהַיְּקוּם צָחַק מֵאֵלָיו.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">צְחוֹק צִינִי</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">צְחוֹק מַר,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">צְחוֹק דֶּבִּילִי</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">שֶׁלֹּא נִגְמַר.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">צְחוֹק לְאֵיד</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וּצְחוֹק מֵעֲבוֹדָה,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">גַּז שֶׁל צְחוֹק</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וּצְחוֹק לְלֹא סִבָּה.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">צְחוֹק חָלוּל גָּדוֹל</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וּצְחוֹק בִּלְתִּי נִשְׁלָט,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">צְחוֹק מֵהַכֹּל</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מֵהַפֶּה נִפְלַט.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲבָל&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לַצְּחוֹק</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;יֵשׁ כְּלָלִים</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְחֻקִּים מִשֶּׁל עַצְמוֹ,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וּכְשֶׁאוֹתוֹ מְמַצִּים</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הוּא נִגְדַּע בְּאִבּוֹ...</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְכָכָה הִגַּעְנוּ</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לַמַּצָּב הַקַּיָּם,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">שֶׁהַצְּחוֹק גּוֹוֵעַ</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מִשִּׂפְתֵי כֻּלָּם.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְאִם אַתָּה רוֹצֶה&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לִפְרֹץ בִּצְחוֹק חָפְשִׁי,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בְּסַדְנַת צְחוֹק, נַסֵּה</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לַעֲשׂוֹת מָנוּי חָדְשִׁי.</span></p>"
}
